WEBVTT

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.330
I'm still waiting on you, Zet!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:44.830
How can I wake him?

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.040
There was another one of you, wasn't there?

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.210
One of your brothers...

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.380
Oh, you're talking about Shuu?

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.220
He's watching over those high school girls.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.800
He really likes killing and girls.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.600
I told him he can do whatever he
wants as long as he doesn't kill them.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.140
For the sake of Konoha and her friend...

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.810
...I can't die in a place like this!

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.900
Damn it!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:30.040
Episode 6: Hostage

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:41.390
Why am I feeling so lost about what to do?

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.550
In a life or death situation like this,

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:47.060
it's stupid to be thinking about how there's no way I can die.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.360
My mind's getting dull.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.770
My head and body feel so damn heavy.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:57.320
The weight of a person's life is so damn heavy.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.360
But... I understand this now!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.830
This is what it means to protect someone, isn't it, Mr. Chairman?

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.830
Mr. Chairman!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.090
No changes in the Zet factors stand out.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.710
Why isn't he using the activation gum?

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.630
Even if he wants to use it, he can't,

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:23.890
because he's not carrying it, right?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.300
It's in his house!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:25.810
Wait!

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.930
Jin will die like this!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.060
He's testing out...

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.770
...another method.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.280
We're getting better data than we could ever have hoped for.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.450
You can't turn into Zet, can you?

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.070
I'm right on the mark, right?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.410
I wonder.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.330
How about we try killing one of the hostages?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:55.000
As brothers, we can talk even if we're separated.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.840
Should I give him the order right now?

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.460
Go for it.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.590
It's just a bluff, anyway.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.840
Wanna give it a try?

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.930
Why the long face?

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.520
This is another part of my body.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.100
It's cute, right?

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.190
I'll give you a kiss...

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.860
Open your eyes!

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.650
Open your eyes! Look!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.360
If you won't, I'll do it to this girl!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.120
No!

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.910
Good girl.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.750
Look at what your family's done!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.260
It's awesome, right? It's amazing!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.720
This is what a Player is!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:57.520
You scared?

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:58.810
Are you scared?

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.530
Your family's the one that made us!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.070
They made the Players!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.950
Shuu-kun's pretty bad.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.280
He's about to kill that girl.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.960
I'm counting on you in case anything happens.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:16.830
OK.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.960
I've found the source of the signal.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.010
Area C,  Block Six of the low class area.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.220
Understood!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.270
Ghost town...

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:43.900
My little brother wants to play around with those girls before killing them.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.610
If you hurry up, you might be able to make it in time.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:00.580
It's coming!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:10.470
If you can't become Zet, you won't be able to do anything!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.360
The Zet factors are going up at a snail's pace.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:27.780
But, it's because he has those factors he can do this.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.500
Don't underestimate Jin-kun.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:46.260
His Zet factors have reached the next level.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:51.840
I'll kill him for real this time!

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.560
It's up to you...

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.290
Wait, Konoha! I'm coming for you now!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.040
What?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.760
What should we play?

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:58.540
I thought that family was something
that just sounded like a bunch of lies.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.590
I want to stay here...

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.380
Maybe I've fallen for him...

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.600
No way! I'm going to take a bath.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.890
This'll change my mood.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.650
My big bro messed up.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.860
Now it's my turn!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.120
It's no good... My medicine...

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.260
His Zet factors have gone quiet again.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.680
The reaction's coming in waves.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:04.850
This is a first!

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.400
Even if his wounds heal,

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:10.770
with instability like this, it'll put too much of a burden on Jin's body.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.530
Can you see inside?

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:17.280
We don't have any cameras set up inside.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.540
Odd...

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.340
I felt the presence of a Player here, but...

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.100
He's here! It's Zet.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.660
It's me!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.660
Calm down, Konoha!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.950
You're safe!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.410
Keep quiet.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.790
A-All right.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.420
Jin-kun...

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.090
There should've been a man in here.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.130
Where did he go?

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:19.430
I don't know.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.760
We're getting out of here.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.180
Keep your wits about you.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.930
But Tomomi should get help before me...

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:28.440
Injured people come first.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:29.900
Grab on.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.650
No! I can get up myse-

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.030
I don't care about that.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:39.950
But... I'm dirty!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.280
Sorry...

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.740
I couldn't come sooner.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.160
I'm sorry.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.630
Jin-kun!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.890
I've been waiting for you, Zet!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.890
Konoha, please hang in there just a bit longer.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:09.730
Wait!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.400
Jin... kun...

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.610
I'll settle this soon.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.150
Keep yourself together until then.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.530
I can finally kill you!

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.780
I'm gonna go all out this time.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.790
Like you could get me with that!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.380
Tomomi...

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:50.270
Tomomi, please calm down!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:51.940
Konoha...

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.100
It's no good...

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.810
I don't have the strength...

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.570
What's wrong, Zet?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.570
Are you finished just with this?

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.430
What are these monsters?

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.770
Don't be scared.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:37.360
I am justice.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:46.570
You...

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:50.790
Jin!

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.750
So it was you, Kouga...

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.830
Are you OK?

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.670
Forget about me.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.170
Get to Konoha, quickly...

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:02.550
What?

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.930
Did you say "Konoha"?!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.680
Konoha's not moving...

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:09.930
Konoha!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.140
Did you find her?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.770
Send in an air ambulance, quickly!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.810
She's bleeding and she needs a blood transfusion!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.860
There's also one heavily injured male.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.150
How are things at the location?

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.070
There are monsters.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.320
Monsters?

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.570
We don't have the luxury of waiting for a helicopter to land.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:31.660
The Flying Hangar will go towards the heli,

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.580
so control it remotely from where you are.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.160
Understood.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.710
How many people can fit on the flying hangar?

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.040
The standard is just for Alphas,

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.960
but it should be fine with Konoha-chan as well.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:43.960
So three people is impossible?

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:45.840
You mean the injured male?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.680
No, Konoha's friend is here, too.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.640
I'll stay here.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.970
What?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:54.430
A lot of homeless people live here.

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.100
If there are still monsters around,

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.730
the number of injuries is only going to increase!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:58.350
You can't.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.270
You're over capacity.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:04.230
Leave behind her friend and the injured man.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:08.740
Like you said, on top of that there's the
possibility that there could be monsters around.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.450
If anything happened to you,

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.620
it'd cause huge problems for the Amagi Corporation.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.290
But I'm Alphas!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.460
I'm going to fight!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.790
Then let me ask this:

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.290
In the ocean, three people are drowning.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.300
Your lifeboat's capacity is two people.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.210
You're the one who went out to rescue them.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.630
Suppose you try to get all four people on
board, given your cheap humanitarianism.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.140
You might save everybody,

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.060
but the chance you'll all drown increases exponentially.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.640
But if you stick to the capacity,

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.390
hold back your tears and leave two people behind,

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:44.020
there's a 99% chance you and one other person will return alive.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.150
What's the smarter choice?

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:48.900
This question...

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.990
Your sister or three high school girls
whose names you don't even know...

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.160
Which will you pick?

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.330
Please stop messing with him!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.750
If he can't make a simple selection like this,

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.790
he's not fit to be Alphas!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.260
What're you doing, Kouga?

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.090
Hurry up!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.380
You get on it, too!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.050
Konoha's going to die at this rate!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.440
Understood.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.320
Take care of Konoha.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:27.650
Y-Yes.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.870
You haven't changed a bit.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.630
Only ever thinking inside the box.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.630
I just wanted to save people like you,

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.260
so I got this power!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.590
The power to fight!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.720
So hurry up and go.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.840
There are other monsters.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.850
You know about these monsters?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.600
Forget about it and go.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:04.270
There are still people I have to protect.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.400
What was that just now?!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.480
Find it!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.790
Are you OK, Nii-chan?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:23.860
Don't come any closer!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:26.250
You guys, run away!

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.590
Nii-chan, you're seriously hurt.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.750
Who did this to you?

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.170
I got it.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.970
It was those guys who always attack us homeless.

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:34.340
Yeah, it must've been them.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.510
If so, we'll be the ones to take 'em out this time!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.520
We've always been protected by Nii-chan,

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.060
so now it's time to repay your kindness!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.140
Repay my kindness?

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:48.650
Everybody knows that you were protecting us.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.150
Now it's our turn to protect you!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:54.320
You can't!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.490
Please run away!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.700
I'm begging you.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.830
You should be the one to get away.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.830
You can't move with your body in that condition.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.250
Your foes aren't human!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.330
They're monsters!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.340
Nevertheless, you just stay here.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.590
Seriously?!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.840
What are they? Shrimps?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.470
If they're shrimps, let's grill them and take a bite!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.600
Zet, get out here.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.100
Or these scraps of garbage are going to die.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.450
Mr. Chairman, this is-

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.190
Jin still hasn't come out.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.780
I'm going in!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.570
You can't go.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.070
Jin is awakening.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.530
There's no reason his hunting instincts would stay asleep...

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.790
...when there's this much violence from the Players.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:43.910
Let's do it!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.680
This place is under the influence of hell!

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:01.640
It's the guy in white!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.520
Alphas!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:08.480
Go now while you can!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.230
Sorry...

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:13.480
Run!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:23.120
Come on, Zet, try a little harder...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.250
Hey. I ran into you again!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.470
You...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.810
You're thinking that you'll become Zet...

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:46.270
...if you injure yourself to the point of nearly dying.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:50.690
Sure, it was like that the first and second time.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.230
W-Why do you know about that?

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.190
Because I've always been watching you.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:03.070
For example, when you were born and things like that...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:08.540
You're beyond the level where you can transform by injuring yourself.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.080
You've entered the final stage.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.590
I'll prove it to you now.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.550
Who are you?!

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.220
Haitani Seiji.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.840
I'm quite the important guy even within EVOL.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.640
Do you know what this is?

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.270
You know about the Ring of Exposure, right?

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:36.400
This is a stake made from the fragments of that ring combined with ceramics.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:39.900
You and the Ring of Exposure resonate with each other.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.530
So...

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.330
You'll adapt to it soon.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.580
What happened, Jin?

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:01.920
I finally got to meet you in your red form.

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:16.230
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:23.070
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:29.320
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:36.000
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:45.550
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.390
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:58.230
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:09.650
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:17.290
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:28.720
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:39.510
It's to carve the names of demons I
defeat into the gravestone of memory.

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:42.230
You're peerless when you're red.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:45.100
I'll hunt you down with my own will.
